 | +$320.75 | ✓ (tax-related), matching submitted values.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Edited transaction: description changed to 'QA Test Expense Entry Updated', amount to $150.25, tax-related unmarked. Table row reflected all changes and Total Expenses updated to -$36,636.24.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created \\\"QA Test Category\\\" (Expense, blue), edited it to \\\"QA Test Category Updated\\\" with rose color, then deleted it via confirmation dialog; it was removed from the Expense Categories list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Transaction form's Category dropdown options changed to only income categories (Sales Revenue, Consulting, Interest Income, Other Income) when Type=Income, and only expense categories when Type=Expense. Selected categories (Consulting, Office Supplies) were retained correctly with the created transactions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created a transaction with Tax Related toggled ON (showed ✓ in Tax column); edited it and toggled Tax Related OFF - the Tax column cell became empty, confirming unmarking works.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combining Type=Income + Category=Consulting + date range 2024-12-01..2024-12-31 yielded exactly the 2 transactions (tx-6, tx-1) satisfying all criteria simultaneously.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing description/amount blocks submission but gives no user-facing error message\", \"actual\": \"Submitting the Add Transaction form with empty Description (amount and category filled) kept the dialog open (creation blocked), but no error text, aria-invalid attribute, red/destructive styling, or toast notification identified the missing Description field to the user.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Invalid date range (start after end) not rejected or explained\", \"actual\": \"Setting From=2024-12-31 and To=2024-12-01 was accepted without any validation error; the app silently displayed \\\"No transactions found / Try adjusting your filters\\\" instead of rejecting the range with an explanation that the start date is after the end date.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Transaction can be created without a category, with no validation or identification to user\", \"actual\": \"Filled Description=\\\"CS-23 Test\\\" and Amount=50 but left Category unselected (\\\"Select category\\\"), then submitted. The transaction was created successfully and appears in the table with a blank Category cell, instead of being blocked with a missing-category message.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-24\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category deletion not blocked and no reassignment offered, leaving transactions with blank category\", \"actual\": \"Deleted the 'Software' expense category (which had 1 assigned transaction) via a confirmation dialog stating \\\"Transactions using this category will not be deleted.\\\" After deletion, transaction tx-10 'Software Subscription - Adobe CC' now shows an empty/blank category value in the Transactions table instead of being blocked, reassigned, or labeled 'Unknown'.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After adding a current-month expense transaction ($120.50, Aug 25 2026) via client-side navigation, Dashboard Monthly Expenses updated $0→$121, Net Profit/Loss $0→-$121, and Recent Transactions list immediately showed the new entry at top.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After editing a transaction to set Tax Related=true, Tax Summary for 2026 immediately updated: transaction count 0→1, expenses $0.00→$150.25, and the transaction appeared in the Office Supplies deductible-expenses breakdown and All Tax-Related Transactions list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Categories page 'Office Supplies' updated from 2 transactions/$1,046 to 3 transactions/$1,166.5 immediately after creating a new $120.50 Office Supplies expense transaction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked 'Print Report' on Tax Summary for year 2024; no new console errors appeared and the page/data remained intact (no application error or crash).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Transactions table columns: Date, Description, Category, Reference, Amount, Tax, Actions; footer shows Total Income +$47,913.25 and Total Expenses -$36,485.99 for the current result set.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"For August 2026 (current month, 2 expense transactions totaling $200.25, $0 income): Reports page shows Income $0, Expenses $200.25, Profit -$200.25, with correct per-category breakdown ($150.25 Office Supplies + $50 Unknown). Dashboard shows matching Monthly Expenses $200 (rounded) and Net Profit -$200, and Recent Transactions lists both current-month entries accurately.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Chart axis labels lack precision for small non-zero amounts\", \"actual\": \"With an Aug (current month) expense of $120.50 present, the 'Income vs Expenses' chart's y-axis gridline labels all read '$0k' (5 labels, all $0k), giving no visual distinction between the $120.50 bar and zero.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
